ation lists, and longer reading content. Its muted identity helps distinguish a work-focused interface from the brighter consumer products in the portfolio."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"caseBand","id":"features","data-reveal":"true","style":"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate(0px, 16px);"},["DIV",{"class":"shell"},["DIV",{"class":"sectionLabel"},["SPAN",{},"02"]," KEY FEATURES"],["DIV",{"class":"caseFeatureHeading"},["H2",{},"A closer look at",["BR"],"the experience",["SPAN",{},"."]],["P",{},"The flows and interface elements visible in ","Infinote","'s original project material."]],["DIV",{"class":"caseFeatureGrid"},["ARTICLE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"approachNumber"},"01"],["H3",{},"Personal home"],["P",{},"A greeting and summary area introduce the user’s workspace."]],["ARTICLE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"approachNumber"},"02"],["H3",{},"Calendar view"],["P",{},"A calendar provides a date-based information surface."]],["ARTICLE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"approachNumber"},"03"],["H3",{},"Document reading"],["P",{},"Longer text content appears in dedicated reading screens."]],["ARTICLE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"approachNumber"},"04"],["H3",{},"Information lists"],["P",{},"Rows and simple icons organize smaller records."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"caseSection shell","id":"design","data-reveal":"true","style":"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate(0px, 16px);"},["DIV",{"class":"sectionLabel"},["SPAN",{},"03"]," DESIGN DIRECTION"],["DIV",{"class":"caseTwoCol"},["DIV",{},["H2",{},"Its own identity.",["BR"],"In every detail",["SPAN",{},"."]],["SPAN",{"class":"disciplineTag"},"Notes & documents"]],["DIV",{"class":"caseBody"},["P",{},"Forest green, cream, and white support a calm reading environment. Compact icons and structured lists create a clear hierarchy, while the calendar introduces a different information pattern within the same restrained visual system."],["DIV",{"class":"designEvidence"},["svg",{"xmlns":"h