{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3859","endTime":352615.862,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 03\nInfinote.\n\nA mobile workspace presenting notes, document content, a calendar, and personal account screens.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nNotes & documents\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nGive everyday information a home.\n\nInfinote’s artwork brings calendar-oriented information and document-style content into a single mobile presentation. The screens show a personal home view, information lists, and longer reading content. Its muted identity helps distinguish a work-focused interface from the brighter consumer products in the portfolio.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Infinote's original project material.\n\n01\nPersonal home\n\nA greeting and summary area introduce the user’s workspace.\n\n02\nCalendar view\n\nA calendar provides a date-based information surface.\n\n03\nDocument reading\n\nLonger text content appears in dedicated reading screens.\n\n04\nInformation lists\n\nRows and simple icons organize smaller records.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nNotes & documents\n\nForest green, cream, and white support a calm reading environment. Compact icons and structured lists create a clear hierarchy, while the calendar introduces a different information pattern within the same restrained visual system.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Infinote.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n02\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n03\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n04\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n05\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nSilasync\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nLOGISTICS & SHIPMENT RECORDS\nSilasync\nHABITS & ROUTINES\nDigital Habit Tracker\nTEAM COMMUNICATION\nTukeeConnect\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
